#: admin/partials/wcpfc-pro-add-new-page.php:466
msgid ""
"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[qty]</span> - total number of items in cart<br>"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[cost]</span> - cost of items<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"
"<span>[weight]</span> - weight of items<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[fee "
"min_fee=20]</span> - Minimum fee to apply<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[fee "
"max_fee=20]</span> - Maximum fee to apply<br><br>Below are some examples:<br>"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>i.</strong> 10.00 -> To add flat 10.00 fee charge."
"<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>ii.</strong> 10.00 * <span>[qty]</span> - To "
"charge 10.00 per quantity in the cart. It will be 50.00 if the cart has 5 "
"quantity.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>iii.</strong> <span>[fee min_fee=20]"
"</span> - This means minimum 20 fee charge will be applicable.<br>&nbsp;"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>iv.</strong> <span>[fee max_fee=20]</span> - This means "
"cart subtotal charge greater than max_fee then maximum 20 charge will be "
"applicable.<br>"
msgstr ""
"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[qty]</span> - número total de artículos en el "
"carrito<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[cost]</span> - costo de los artículos<br>"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[weight]</span> - peso de los artículos<br>&nbsp;"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[fee min_fee=20]</span> - Tarifa mínima a aplicar<br>&nbsp;"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>[fee max_fee=20]</span> - Tarifa máxima a aplicar<br><br>A "
"continuación se muestran algunos ejemplos:<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>i.</ "
"strong> 10,00 -> Para agregar un cargo fijo de 10,00.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"
"<strong>ii.</strong> 10,00 * <span>[qty]</span> - Para cobrar 10,00 por "
"cantidad en el carro. Será de 50,00 si el carrito tiene 5 cantidades.<br>"
"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>iii.</strong> <span>[fee min_fee=20]</span>: esto "
"significa que se cobrará una tarifa mínima de 20 aplicable.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;"
"&nbsp;<strong>iv.</strong> <span>[fee max_fee=20]</span>: esto significa que "
"el cargo subtotal del carrito es superior a max_fee, luego se aplicará un "
"cargo máximo de 20 .<br>"

